1
00:00:00,433 --> 00:00:03,163
(Sheldon:)So, what
brings you by?
Well,

2
00:00:03,169 --> 00:00:05,969
(Howard:)I don't need a reason--
it's my house.

3
00:00:05,972 --> 00:00:08,272
(Stuart:)Technically,
it's your mom's house, but...

4
00:00:08,274 --> 00:00:11,244
(Stuart:)we certainly want you
to feel welcome.

5
00:00:11,244 --> 00:00:13,974
(Howard:)I'm always welcome.

6
00:00:13,980 --> 00:00:16,910
(Stuart:)Mm, just... try and call first.

7
00:00:16,916 --> 00:00:20,156
(Bernadette:)Okay, let's get
down to business.

8
00:00:20,153 --> 00:00:22,523
(Bernadette:)Howie was thinking about
putting up some money

9
00:00:22,522 --> 00:00:25,492
(Bernadette:)to help you reopen the store,
but before that happens,

10
00:00:25,492 --> 00:00:27,492
(Bernadette:)I have a few questions.
Oh.

11
00:00:27,494 --> 00:00:28,924
(Stuart:)I appreciate the offer,

12
00:00:28,928 --> 00:00:31,898
(Stuart:)but actually your mother
already gave me the money.

13
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:36,000
(Howard:)What?

14
00:00:36,002 --> 00:00:38,202
(Stuart:)Yeah. I told her
it was too much,

15
00:00:38,204 --> 00:00:41,304
(Stuart:)but she said she was happy
to help out her bubala.

16
00:00:41,307 --> 00:00:42,577
(chuckles)

17
00:00:42,575 --> 00:00:44,705
(Raj:)Excuse me.

18
00:00:45,879 --> 00:00:48,249
Ma, you are canceling
that check,

19
00:00:48,248 --> 00:00:50,948
and Stuart is not your bubala;
I'm your bubala.

20
00:00:50,950 --> 00:00:54,250
(Howard:)You can't have more
than one bubala!

21
00:00:54,254 --> 00:00:55,954
(Penny:)I don't know
who he's talking to.

22
00:00:55,955 --> 00:01:01,025
(Stuart:)She's at Target,
buying me shirts.

